            "content": "## Test data assumption\n\nThe Claude account must have access to `claude-sonnet-5-5`, a model with extended thinking. Its response starts with a `thinking` block; before ai.claude 1.2.2 Send Prompt returned an empty Answer for it (issue #3021). Keep Max Tokens high (4096) so thinking cannot use the whole budget."
